      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不作图，求线性方程 $0.3x-0.4y=12$ 的图象和 а) 横轴、",
        "б) 纵轴的交点坐标。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "451",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一个两位数等于它的两个数字的和的五倍，求这个数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "§9. 线性方程组"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "26. 由两个二元线性方程组成的",
        "方程组解的个数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来讨论二元线性方程组，其中每一个方程至少有一",
        "个系数不等于零。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用图解法解这种方程组，可以归结为求两条直线交点的",
        "坐标。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们知道，平面上两条直线或相交，或平行。平行又有两",
        "种情况，一是两直线没有交点，一是两直线重合。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下面对每一种情况分别进行讨论。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1) 设已知方程组",
        "$\\begin{cases}3x+y=-11,\\\\↵x-2y=8.\\end{cases}$",
        "将每个方程中的 $y$ 用 $x$ 来表示，得到方程组：",
        "$\\begin{cases}y=-3x-11,\\\\↵y=0.5x-4.\\end{cases}$",
        "两个方程的图象即直线的斜率不同（$-3$ 和 $0.5$），所以两直线",
        "相交。"
      ]
    },
